NotificationConfigResponse.description:
GET/PUT response — notification config + tier capabilities.

``channel_ids`` is the raw stored reference list (preserved verbatim, even
for ids whose channel was since deleted). ``channels`` is the resolved,
secret-masked view of those ids against the account's notification channels;
a ``channel_id`` that no longer resolves (deleted channel) is kept in
``channel_ids`` but omitted from ``channels``.
